  description_zh = {学习量化神经表征，以提升语音解码的准确性和鲁棒性。},
  abstract = {We train a quantized representation-learning network to map neural activity onto a discrete latent space for speech decoding. Experiments using stereotactic EEG recordings from 11 participants show improved decoding precision and robustness. The results support using discrete neural representations in speech brain-computer interfaces.},
